CONDITIONAL OBLIGATION (FINANCIAL-STATUS ADAPTIVE):

Should we ever meet in person, and you have utilized this software in any shape,
form, or capacity, your obligations shall be determined strictly by your current
financial standing:

1. IF YOU HAVE SUFFICIENT FUNDS (YOU ARE SOLVENT / "MASZ SIANO"):
   You are strictly obligated to purchase me a pizza. The toppings shall be
   either selected at my discretion upon order, or defaulted strictly to
   Quattro Formaggi (4 Cheeses). Stop being stingy and buy the pizza, you absolute legend.

2. IF FUNDS ARE MODEST (STANDARD / CAFFEINE-FRIENDLY):
   Should a pizza exceed your budget, you are obligated to provide one 
   non-alcoholic beer. If it is early in the day or caffeine is preferred, a 
   fresh coffee is a fully legally binding substitute.

3. IF YOU ARE BROKE (ZERO FUNDS / "BRAK SIANA"):
   You are completely exempt from all monetary obligations. You are required only 
   to approach me, say hello, formally state that you are fulfilling your license 
   obligation, and enjoy yourself. No hard feelings—have fun and carry on.
